[h1]multiplayer-undo[/h1]
Rewind combat together in Slay the Spire 2. Choose an earlier action or restart the current fight while keeping the multiplayer room and connections.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]Press [b]Left Arrow[/b] during combat to open the history window.
[*]Choose an earlier action, or select [b]Restart Combat[/b].
[*]The proposer automatically agrees. Every other player must accept before restoration starts.
[*]After everyone finishes restoration and their results agree, continue playing from the selected point.
[/list]

[h2]v0.1.19[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fixes restoration errors with game v0.113.0, including Fool runs.
[*]Fixes callbacks into the outgoing map after its screen has been removed.
[*]Fixes internal state-update exceptions while discarding the old combat; restored combat keeps its native UI and gameplay effects.
[*]Retains the current multiplayer room, recorded choices and final restored-state agreement.
[/list]

[h2]Before playing[/h2]
[list]
[*]Every player must enable the mod, update to [b]v0.1.19[/b], and restart the game.
[*]History is kept in memory during the current session.
[*]Tested on game v0.113.0 with Fool Standard/Blitz content and local three-player ENet timing fuzzing: 30 seed pairs, 50 undo operations. Separate-computer Steam multiplayer remains unverified.
[/list]

[h2]Languages[/h2]
English, Korean, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese. Each player sees the UI in their own game language. Other languages use English.

[h2]한국어[/h2]
전투 중 [b]왼쪽 방향키[/b]로 기록을 열고 이전 행동 또는 [b]전투 다시 시작[/b]을 선택하세요. 제안자는 자동 동의하며, 다른 플레이어가 모두 수락하면 같은 방에서 복원합니다. v0.1.19는 최신 게임 v0.113.0에서 복원 중 발생하던 지도 오류와 이전 전투 정리 중의 내부 상태 갱신 예외를 수정합니다. Fool 일반·블리츠 및 로컬 3인 타이밍 퍼징으로 검증했습니다. 모든 플레이어가 같은 버전으로 업데이트한 뒤 게임을 다시 실행하세요.

[h2]简体中文[/h2]
战斗中按[b]左方向键[/b]打开历史记录，选择之前的行动或[b]重新开始战斗[/b]。提议者自动同意，其他玩家全部接受后在当前房间恢复。v0.1.19修复了游戏v0.113.0恢复时的地图错误，以及清理旧战斗时的内部状态更新异常。已验证Fool普通模式、Blitz模式及本地三人时序模糊测试。所有玩家需更新到同一版本并重启游戏。

[h2]繁體中文[/h2]
戰鬥中按[b]左方向鍵[/b]開啟歷史紀錄，選擇先前的行動或[b]重新開始戰鬥[/b]。提議者自動同意，其餘玩家全部接受後在目前房間還原。v0.1.19修正遊戲v0.113.0還原時的地圖錯誤，以及清理舊戰鬥時的內部狀態更新例外。已驗證Fool一般模式、Blitz模式及本機三人時序模糊測試。所有玩家須更新至相同版本並重新啟動遊戲。

